# =============================================================================
# .gitignore  --  MyTutor  --  Hyperion Shift LLC
# CHANGE NOTES (keep newest at top):
#   2026-07-30  MARKET-PREP HARDENING. Added belt-and-braces exclusions so secrets and
#               dev/test artifacts can never ship even if created locally later:
#               .mtenv (local API-key file pattern used during testing -- a leak path
#               if ever created in the repo dir), local SQLite DBs, logs, test
#               transcripts/batteries (*.jsonl), screenshots, run-state files, and the
#               _to_delete/ staging folder. Also renamed header to MyTutor.
#   2026-07-19  Initial. Keeps Python cache and saved student sessions out of git
#               so we never commit conversation data or stale caches.
# NOTE: git treats '#' lines as comments, so these notes are safe here.
# =============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/sessions.json
data/placements.json
data/*.tmp
data/tts_cache/
.env
.mtenv
*.mtenv
node_modules/
package-lock.json
# --- local databases / logs / dev artifacts (never commit) ---
*.db
*.sqlite
*.log
*.jsonl
dry*.png
run_state.json
*_state.json
_to_delete/
_fresh_*
.venv/
# NOTE: static/chart.umd.min.js IS committed on purpose (bundled Chart.js library).
# I did no harm and this file is not truncated.
